Soft deletion rule

[3] source=R37 type=Requirement/SrcChunk hops=0 chunk=9978dc0dcd43a512 doc=JIRA-Item.md rel=TARGET
": "Terminology check: the deletion outcome described in the specification does not map cleanly to the status values currently supported in the database. I need confirmation whether deleted items should reuse a non-rentable status or whether this requires a separate lifecycle value."
      }
    ]
  }
]

